{"type":"message","id":"cfe69b2b","parentId":"3060b424","timestamp":"2026-04-01T05:26:57.432Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking about a command that didn't run - `curl -s \"wttr.in/Shanghai?format=%l:+%c+%t+%h+%w&lang=zh\"`. This was an exec command that was denied due to approval timeout. The webchat channel doesn't have exec approval configured, so exec commands require approval.\n\nI should explain this briefly and offer what I can do instead. I already got the weather using web_fetch as a workaround, so the weather data was retrieved successfully.","thinkingSignature":"7275bb6473ef4f2514169178bfba1bb1e0db08ec7b79a0d72261a1d2fbe8602b"},{"type":"text","text":"<final>\n那个 `curl` 命令没跑起来——webchat 渠道不支持直接 exec，需要在 OpenClaw 配置里开启审批（Discord/Slack/Telegram 其一），或者每次手动 `/approve`。\n\n不过没关系，我已经用 `web_fetch` 绕过去了，weather 已经拿到了：🌫 上海现在 **17°C**，有雾。\n\n如果你想让我定时跑带 curl 的命令，需要先配一下 exec 审批渠道。\n</final>"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":86,"output":197,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":27402,"totalTokens":27685,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775021209645,"responseId":"061bdf991919df0b18633a8a27616da2"}}
